<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: ancient obsidia beacon -->
  <OE_Beacon_CAC.label>远古黑曜石信标</OE_Beacon_CAC.label>
  <!-- EN: The Ancient Obsidia Beacon was previously used in the old wars to call for reinforcements. This very old device is running at an unknown frequency and all serial numbers have been erased. So it's impossible to determine who will respond to this beacon.\n\nMechanitor is required to use this device. -->
  <OE_Beacon_CAC.description>远古黑曜石信标曾在旧时代战争中用于召唤援军。这个非常古老的设备运行在未知频率上，所有序列号都已被抹除。因此无法确定谁会响应这个信标。\n\n需要机械师才能使用此设备。</OE_Beacon_CAC.description>
  <!-- EN: Summon /unknown/ obsidia squad -->
  <OE_Beacon_CAC.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>召唤/未知/黑曜石小队</OE_Beacon_CAC.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>
  
  <!-- EN: crimson arachna beacon -->
  <OE_Beacon_CrimsonArachna.label>猩红蜘蛛信标</OE_Beacon_CrimsonArachna.label>
  <!-- EN: Crimson Arachna beacon used to imitate the call signal of the Crimson Arachna Cult mech army. Signal will attract an ultra-heavy Arachna Queen mechanoid with its Arachna escorts, in the worst case, a Crimson Arachna can react to the signal. The signal pulse burns out the transmitter, so this building can only be used once.\n\nMechanitor is required to use this device. -->
  <OE_Beacon_CrimsonArachna.description>猩红蜘蛛信标用于模拟猩红蜘蛛教派机械军队的召唤信号。信号将吸引一个超重型的蜘蛛女王机械体及其护卫蜘蛛，最坏情况下，一只猩红蜘蛛会对信号做出反应。信号脉冲会烧毁发射器，因此此建筑只能使用一次。\n\n需要机械师才能使用此设备。</OE_Beacon_CrimsonArachna.description>
  <!-- EN: Summon Crimson Arachna Cult's mechanoids army -->
  <OE_Beacon_CrimsonArachna.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>召唤猩红蜘蛛教派的机械军队</OE_Beacon_CrimsonArachna.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>
  
  <!-- EN: Fallen Legion beacon -->
  <OE_Beacon_FallenLegion.label>堕落军团信标</OE_Beacon_FallenLegion.label>
  <!-- EN: Fallen Legion beacon used to imitate the call signal of the Obsidia Empire Sins mech army. Signal will attract an ultra-tech, fortress-sized mechanoid Fallen Legion mechanoid with its escorts. The signal pulse burns out the transmitter, so this building can only be used once.\n\nMechanitor is required to use this device. -->
  <OE_Beacon_FallenLegion.description>堕落军团信标用于模拟黑曜石帝国罪孽机械军队的召唤信号。信号将吸引一个高科技、要塞级的堕落军团机械体及其护卫。信号脉冲会烧毁发射器，因此此建筑只能使用一次。\n\n需要机械师才能使用此设备。</OE_Beacon_FallenLegion.description>
  <!-- EN: Summon Fallen Legion -->
  <OE_Beacon_FallenLegion.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>召唤堕落军团</OE_Beacon_FallenLegion.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>
  
